-- s 5(2)(c), Cat Regulations r 9.
GIVEN b IS A `Body`, fc IS A MAYBE `Foster care`
GIVETH A `Cat`
`an unregistered cat in the custody of` b `in foster care` fc MEANS `Cat` WITH
    `cat name` IS "Stray", `is an animal of the species felis catus or a hybrid of that species` IS TRUE
    `born on` IS `the date` 2020 6 1, `keepers` IS EMPTY, `ordinarily kept in the district of` IS "City of Perth"
    `is kept in the State` IS TRUE, `has died` IS FALSE, `registrations` IS EMPTY
    `implant` IS NOTHING, `microchip database company` IS NOTHING
    `name recorded as owner in a microchip database` IS NOTHING, `there is evidence to the contrary of that record` IS FALSE
    `sterilisation` IS NOTHING, `has a sterilisation tattoo on its ear` IS FALSE
    `microchipping health certificate` IS NOTHING, `sterilisation health certificate` IS NOTHING
    `is owned for the purpose of breeding` IS FALSE, `in the custody of` IS b, `foster care` IS fc

