#ASSERT `s 5(2)(c), 9(2)(b) -- belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from registration` (`an unregistered cat in the custody of` (`veterinary premises` TRUE) `in foster care` NOTHING)
-- Foster care placed by a SAFE entity: exempt up to a total of 12 weeks (84 days), not beyond.
