#ASSERT NOT `s 5(2)(c), 9(2)(b) -- belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from registration` (`an unregistered cat in the custody of` `a foster carer` `in foster care` (JUST (`Foster care` WITH `placed by` IS `a SAFE entity` `S.A.F.E. Hedland Inc`, `total days the cat has been in foster care` IS 85)))
-- Placed by Cat Haven: no limit.
#ASSERT `s 5(2)(c), 9(2)(b) -- belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from registration` (`an unregistered cat in the custody of` `a foster carer` `in foster care` (JUST (`Foster care` WITH `placed by` IS `Cat Haven`, `total days the cat has been in foster care` IS 400)))
#ASSERT NOT `s 5(2)(c), 9(2)(b) -- belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from registration` (`an unregistered cat in the custody of` `a foster carer` `in foster care` (JUST (`Foster care` WITH `placed by` IS `anyone else` "a neighbour", `total days the cat has been in foster care` IS 10)))

§ `Division 1 -- ss 6, 7 Tags`

GIVEN d IS A `Calendar date`, public IS A BOOLEAN, tag IS A BOOLEAN, shown IS A MAYBE `Show holder`, defence IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `Outing`
`an outing on` d public tag shown defence MEANS `Outing` WITH
    `outing date` IS d
    `the cat is in a place to which the public has lawful access` IS public
    `the cat is wearing its registration tag` IS tag
    `the cat is being exhibited for show purposes at a cat show held by` IS shown
    `the contravention was due to the act or default of another person, an accident, or some other cause beyond the accused's control` IS defence
    `the accused took reasonable precautions and could not by the exercise of due diligence have prevented the commission of the offence` IS defence

