§ `Regulations -- r 12 periods (FORKS 05, 06), r 12(2)(b), r 13-r 19`

-- FORK-05: one year from 31 October 2026. Reading A (taken): until 31 October 2027.
#ASSERT `r 12(2)(a)(i) -- the next 31 October after` (`the date` 2026 10 31) EQUALS `the date` 2027 10 31
-- Reading B: until that same day.
