§ `Division 4 -- ss 22-24 Transfer`

GIVEN c IS A `Cat`, k IS A `Kind of transfer`, d IS A `Calendar date`, from IS A STRING, to IS A MAYBE STRING, recipient IS A `Body`, voucher IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Transfer`
`a transfer of` c k d from to recipient voucher MEANS `Transfer` WITH
    `the cat transferred` IS c, `kind` IS k, `made on` IS d
    `the person parting with the cat` IS from, `the person receiving the cat` IS to, `the recipient is` IS recipient
    `transferor is satisfied that a s 14(2) certificate applies` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that a s 18(2)(a) certificate applies` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that the purchaser is an approved cat breeder purchasing the cat for the purpose of breeding` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that the cat belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation` IS FALSE
    `a voucher is given to the purchaser to have the cat sterilised later by a veterinarian at no cost to the purchaser` IS voucher

-- Ana sells Tom, unchipped and entire, to Ben.
`Ana sells Tom to Ben` MEANS `a transfer of` `Tom` `sell` (`the date` 2026 10 1) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") FALSE
#ASSERT `s 23(1) -- contravened by the transfer` `Ana sells Tom to Ben`
#ASSERT `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` `Ana sells Tom to Ben`
#ASSERT `the person named` "Ana" `contravenes s 23 by` `Ana sells Tom to Ben`
#ASSERT NOT `the person named` "Ben" `contravenes s 23 by` `Ana sells Tom to Ben`
-- With a desexing voucher, s 23(2) is met (s 23(1) is not).
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` (`a transfer of` `Tom` `sell` (`the date` 2026 10 1) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") TRUE)
-- Tess is chipped and desexed: nothing to contravene.
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(1) -- contravened by the transfer` (`a transfer of` `Tess` `give away` (`the date` 2026 10 1) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` (`a transfer of` `Tess` `give away` (`the date` 2026 10 1) "Ana" (JUST "Ben") (`anyone else` "Ben") FALSE)
