    `the cat transferred` IS `Tom`, `kind` IS `sell`, `made on` IS `the date` 2026 10 1
    `the person parting with the cat` IS "Ana", `the person receiving the cat` IS JUST "Ben", `the recipient is` IS `anyone else` "Ben"
