    `transferor is satisfied that a s 18(2)(a) certificate applies` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that the purchaser is an approved cat breeder purchasing the cat for the purpose of breeding` IS FALSE
    `transferor is satisfied that the cat belongs to a class of cats prescribed as exempt from sterilisation` IS TRUE
    `a voucher is given to the purchaser to have the cat sterilised later by a veterinarian at no cost to the purchaser` IS FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `s 23(1) -- contravened by the transfer` `Ana sells Tom, satisfied of an exempt class`
#ASSERT `s 23(2) -- contravened by the transfer` `Ana sells Tom, satisfied of an exempt class`

