#ASSERT `s 24(a) -- notice to a local government is required for` `Ana offers renewed Tess for sale`
#ASSERT NOT `s 24 -- there is a purchaser to name in` `Ana offers renewed Tess for sale`
#ASSERT `s 24 -- the seller in` `Ana offers renewed Tess for sale` `contravenes the section, having given` (LIST `a notice of the purchaser to` "City of Perth" `on` (`the date` 2026 12 21), `a notice of the purchaser to` "PetBase Pty Ltd, trading as Petsafe" `on` (`the date` 2026 12 21)) `, on` (`the date` 2026 12 30) `given the holidays` `the holidays`

§ `Division 5 -- s 25 Changes`

-- Ana, owner of the renewed Tess, moves house on Friday 18 December 2026.
GIVEN d IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH A `Notice`
`to the council on` d MEANS `Notice` WITH `given on` IS d, `in writing` IS TRUE, `given to` IS "City of Perth", `items` IS LIST `the cat owner's residential address`, `the address at which the cat is normally kept`
GIVEN d IS A `Calendar date`
GIVETH A `Notice`
`to Petsafe on` d MEANS `Notice` WITH `given on` IS d, `in writing` IS TRUE, `given to` IS "PetBase Pty Ltd, trading as Petsafe", `items` IS LIST `the cat owner's residential address`, `the address at which the cat is normally kept`

#ASSERT `s 25(a) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat owner's residential address` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
#ASSERT `s 25(b) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat owner's residential address` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
#ASSERT NOT `s 25 --` `Ana` `contravenes the section for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat owner's residential address` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18) `, having given` (LIST `to the council on` (`the date` 2026 12 29), `to Petsafe on` (`the date` 2026 12 29)) `, on` (`the date` 2026 12 30) `given the holidays` `the holidays`
#ASSERT `s 25 --` `Ana` `contravenes the section for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat owner's residential address` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18) `, having given` (LIST `to the council on` (`the date` 2026 12 29)) `, on` (`the date` 2026 12 30) `given the holidays` `the holidays`
-- The postal address is in r 16, not r 17: only the local government need be told.
#ASSERT `s 25(a) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat owner's postal address` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
#ASSERT NOT `s 25(b) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat owner's postal address` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
-- FORK-15: the cat's age. Reading A (taken): no duty. Reading B: a duty to tell the company.
#ASSERT NOT `s 25(b) -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat's age` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
#ASSERT `s 25(b), reading B -- the duty applies to` `Ana` `for` `Tess, renewed` `on a change to` `the cat's age` `on` (`the date` 2026 12 18)
